Boss(Starting) {

* (Starting)
| True ? Protect(16000) :(Blocking)

* (Fighting)
| Struck(Projectile) ? Hit(1) :(LifeCheck)
| Timer ? Protect(2500) :(Charging)
| True ? Throw(F) :(Fighting)

* (Charging)
| Struck(Projectile) ? Hit(1) :(ChargeLifeCheck)
| Timer ? Protect(3000) :(Blocking)
| True ? :(Charging)

* (LifeCheck)
| Life(0) ? Explode :(Dead)
| True ? :(Fighting)

* (ChargeLifeCheck)
| Life(0) ? Explode :(Dead)
| True ? :(Charging)

* (Blocking)
| Timer ? Protect(6000) :(Fighting)
| True ? :(Blocking)

* (Dead)
| True ? Rest :(Dead)
}